*April 2025: Sheila Murphy (Conservative) and Fiona Marsh (Conservative) leave party to sit as independents<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothoryd |first1=David |title=Reform go to Bognor |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2025/04/reform-go-to-bognor/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=10 February 2026}}</ref>
*July 2025: Mark Reed (Conservative) dies – by-election held October 2025<ref>{{cite news |last1=Meyler |first1=Piers |title=Tributes pour in for former Essex mayor after 'unexpected death' |url=https://www.essexlive.news/news/essex-news/tributes-former-brentwood-mayor-after-10324659 |access-date=10 February 2026 |work=Essex Live |date=7 July 2025 |language=en}}</ref>
*October 2025: Russell Quirk (Reform) gains by-election from Conservatives<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project — Hutton South Ward |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/ward/24750/#2025-10-02 |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=10 February 2026}}</ref>

